1
00:00:02,120 --> 00:00:03,238
Kincir air di bagian ketiga,

2
00:00:03,593 --> 00:00:04,810
coba kamu gambar.

3
00:00:04,885 --> 00:00:05,083
Gam-gambar…

4
00:00:05,554 --> 00:00:06,387
Gambar apa?

5
00:00:06,856 --> 00:00:07,489
Ehem,

6
00:00:07,550 --> 00:00:08,211
Omong kosong!

7
00:00:08,513 --> 00:00:09,403
Pukul dia!

8
00:00:09,999 --> 00:00:10,565
Tunggu.

9
00:00:10,703 --> 00:00:11,726
Beri mereka kertas.

10
00:00:12,199 --> 00:00:13,380
Tulisan bisa dihafal,

11
00:00:13,436 --> 00:00:14,347
kincir airnya?

12
00:00:21,491 --> 00:00:23,071
Dua belas bilah,

13
00:00:24,296 --> 00:00:25,592
miring tiga derajat.

14
00:00:27,865 --> 00:00:28,564
Benar,

15
00:00:28,632 --> 00:00:30,279
persis yang ini.

16
00:00:30,345 --> 00:00:30,972
Wei Xun,

17
00:00:31,130 --> 00:00:32,305
mana kincir airmu?

18
00:00:34,607 --> 00:00:34,984
Bilahnya,

19
00:00:35,247 --> 00:00:36,452
kenapa dipasang terbalik?

20
00:00:36,874 --> 00:00:37,182
Aku…

21
00:00:37,252 --> 00:00:38,318
Yang kuhafal itu…

22
00:00:38,396 --> 00:00:38,861
Hafalan?

23
00:00:38,983 --> 00:00:39,809
Hafalan siapa?

24
00:00:41,454 --> 00:00:43,759
Pertama kali kupasang terbalik,

25
00:00:43,825 --> 00:00:44,856
kincirnya tidak berputar.

26
00:00:45,765 --> 00:00:47,095
Adikku menunjukkannya dengan kincir kertas,

27
00:00:47,332 --> 00:00:49,120
baru aku membaliknya.

28
00:00:49,182 --> 00:00:49,963
Sebelum ujian,

29
00:00:50,113 --> 00:00:51,571
di ruang bacaku

30
00:00:51,728 --> 00:00:53,369
dia menggambar kincir ini.

31
00:00:53,585 --> 00:00:53,921
Ehem,

32
00:00:54,076 --> 00:00:56,199
Pelajar menghafal teks,

33
00:00:57,256 --> 00:00:58,890
apa anehnya!

34
00:00:59,378 --> 00:01:00,078
Tuan!

35
00:01:00,137 --> 00:01:01,202
Hamba ingin menyerahkan sesuatu!

36
00:01:02,021 --> 00:01:03,179
Orang keluarga Wei itu

37
00:01:03,239 --> 00:01:04,696
datang lagi menemui Penguji Feng.

38
00:01:05,415 --> 00:01:07,186
Ini bungkusan kedua,

39
00:01:07,262 --> 00:01:07,737
aku yang menerimanya untuknya.

40
00:01:10,362 --> 00:01:11,396
Lima ratus tael,

41
00:01:11,461 --> 00:01:13,277
lunas saat pengumuman.

42
00:01:13,368 --> 00:01:14,415
Aku kenal cap ini,

43
00:01:14,721 --> 00:01:16,239
milik pengurus rumah Wei Shaoqing.

44
00:01:16,422 --> 00:01:16,747
Tuan,

45
00:01:17,218 --> 00:01:19,048
Hamba difitnah…

46
00:01:19,638 --> 00:01:20,284
Tangkap dia!

47
00:01:23,238 --> 00:01:23,696
Keluar semua.

48
00:01:26,438 --> 00:01:27,249
Kalau menyeret keluarga Wei,

49
00:01:27,571 --> 00:01:29,829
kasusnya dibawa ke ibu kota.

50
00:01:29,895 --> 00:01:31,547
Tiga tahun tak selesai,

51
00:01:31,630 --> 00:01:32,922
ujian angkatanmu ini hangus.

52
00:01:33,579 --> 00:01:34,655
Cukup adili Penguji Feng,

53
00:01:35,169 --> 00:01:35,772
dan besok,

54
00:01:36,125 --> 00:01:37,113
kamu juara pertama ujian provinsi.

55
00:01:37,645 --> 00:01:40,175
Pilihan: jatuhkan keluarga Wei,

56
00:01:40,261 --> 00:01:43,047
atau ambil juara pertama dulu.
